These are parts and accessories of passenger vehicles, so heading 8708 is the best fit. Subheading 8708.99 covers other parts and accessories, and the 8708.99.81 line covers "Other" parts, with 8708.99.8180 being the "Other" statistical suffix.

Roll bars and cages are structural parts that are not bumpers, body stampings, or safety seat belts. Heading 8708.29 covers other parts and accessories of bodies, including cabs, but roll bars are not stamped body parts. CBP rulings on roll bars and strut braces have generally used 8708.99.8180.

{"hts_code": "8708.99.8180", "reason": "Bolt-on or weld-in roll bars, strut tower braces, underbody X-braces and roll cages are structural parts and accessories of passenger motor vehicles of heading 8708, falling in the residual 'other parts' provision of 8708.99.81."}
